281
00:36:31,321 --> 00:36:35,121
呼びかける声
A voice calling out...

282
00:36:35,921 --> 00:36:39,121
Whisper, Whisper, Whisper まだ触らせない
Whisper, Whisper, Whisper still won't let you touch

283
00:36:39,121 --> 00:36:44,021
この檻を抜け出して 悪魔は駆ける
Breaking out of this cage, the demon runs...

284
00:36:44,521 --> 00:36:48,321
鏡の前で この口のせい 伝えたい言葉さえ
Before the mirror, because of this mouth, even the words I want to convey...

285
00:36:48,321 --> 00:36:51,721
噛み殺す夜
Are bitten back tonight...

286
00:36:52,021 --> 00:36:55,721
Whisper, Whisper, Whisper まだ打ち明けない 神様を裏切って
Whisper, Whisper, Whisper haven't been confessed yet, betraying God

287
00:36:55,721 --> 00:37:00,121
悪魔と過ごす
And spending time with the demon...

288
00:37:00,521 --> 00:37:07,921
曖昧に 夢見ていたい あなたに そっと 気付かせて あげたいだけ
I just want to gently make you, who want to dream ambiguously, realize it...

289
00:37:08,421 --> 00:37:15,121
Oh あなたにも oh あなたにも oh あなたにも
Oh, to you too... Oh, to you too... Oh, to you too...

290
00:37:15,821 --> 00:37:24,121
消えない 傷を隠したい あなたに そっと 悩ませて あげたいだけ
I just want to secretly make you troubled, wanting to hide the unforgettable scars...

291
00:37:24,821 --> 00:37:31,421
Oh あなたにも oh あなたにも 悪魔を探す
Oh, to you too... Oh, to you too... Searching for the demon...

292
