301
00:38:23,421 --> 00:38:26,421
好き 嫌い 常識 I don't care 吹っ飛べ BANG!!!
Like, dislike, common sense, I don't care, blow it up BANG!!!

302
00:38:26,421 --> 00:38:30,121
かかってこい Majority あたしに負けはなし
Come on, Majority, I have no losses against anyone

303
00:38:30,121 --> 00:38:33,421
ここまでって引かれた そのボーダー 誰のルール？
The border line drawn as "up to here" - whose rules are those?

304
00:38:33,421 --> 00:38:39,421
あの日乗り越えた Weak heart 強くなったあたしが笑い飛ばしてあげる
The weak heart I overcame that day, the stronger me will just laugh it off

305
00:38:40,421 --> 00:38:45,921
言いたい事は言う やりたくない事はしない 悪意気にしない
I say what I want to say, I don't do what I don't want to do, I don't care about malice

306
00:38:47,021 --> 00:38:53,421
皆違うの当然だし あたしも変わんない
It's only natural that everyone is different, and I haven't changed either

307
00:38:56,421 --> 00:39:04,121
Yesも Noも言わない それじゃ何も変えられない
Saying neither Yes nor No - nothing can be changed that way

308
00:39:04,421 --> 00:39:07,121
生きてるんだ あたし
I'm alive, I am!

309
00:39:07,121 --> 00:39:15,121
ねえ 生きてるんだ あたし
Hey, I'm alive, I am!

310
00:39:15,921 --> 00:39:20,421
生まれたその時から選んできたんだ
I've chosen my path ever since the moment I was born

311
00:39:21,421 --> 00:39:25,121
思い出せ あたしはあたしだ
Remember that I am myself

312
00:39:25,421 --> 00:39:34,121
不可能な事など何一つもない 嘘じゃない
There's not a single thing that's impossible, it's not a lie

313
00:39:34,421 --> 00:39:39,121
なりたい自分に
To be the person I want to be...

314
00:39:40,121 --> 00:39:43,421
好き 嫌い 常識 I don't care 吹っ飛べ BANG!!!
