318
00:42:48,998 --> 00:42:52,728
流れてく時のなかででもけだるさが
Even as time flows by, this listlessness...

319
00:42:52,928 --> 00:42:56,728
ほらぐるぐる回って私から離れる
Look, it spins round and round, pulling away from me...

320
00:42:56,928 --> 00:43:03,028
心も見えないわそう知らないわ周りのことなど
An unseen heart, knowing nothing of those around me...

321
00:43:03,228 --> 00:43:07,428
私は私それだけ夢見てる?
I am just me, that is all. Are you dreaming?

322
00:43:07,628 --> 00:43:11,428
何も見てない?語るも無駄な自分の言葉?
What are you looking at? Talking about your own useless self...

323
00:43:11,628 --> 00:43:15,528
悲しむなんて疲れるだけよ何も感じず過ごせばいいの
Being sad is just exhausting; it's fine to spend your days feeling nothing at all.

324
00:43:15,728 --> 00:43:21,428
戸惑う言葉与えられても自分の心ただうわのそら
Even if given words of confusion, my heart is simply absent.

325
00:43:21,628 --> 00:43:28,428
もし私から動くのならばすべて変えるのならば黒にする
If I am to make a move myself, if I'm going to change everything, I'll turn it black.

326
00:43:28,628 --> 00:43:32,428
こんな自分に未来はあるの?こんな世界に私はいるの?
Does such a self have a future? Am I even in a world like this?

327
00:43:32,628 --> 00:43:37,428
今切ないの?今悲しいの?自分のこともわからないまま
Now it hurts, now it's sad, not even understanding my own self.

328
00:43:37,628 --> 00:43:42,428
歩むことさえ疲れるだけよ何も感じず過ごせばいいの
Just walking is exhausting; it's fine to spend your days feeling nothing at all.

329
